{% set local_problem %}
<p>Elkmont properties often have older gutters — or no gutters at all. Many homes here were built decades ago with different drainage standards. Sectional gutters leak at seams, undersized systems overflow during storms, and years of patch repairs have left many homes with gutters that barely function.</p>

<p>Seamless gutters solve these problems. Custom fabrication means gutters that fit your roofline exactly, with no leak-prone seams along the runs.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Seamless gutters are continuous gutters with no seams except at corners and downspouts. We fabricate them on-site using our portable gutter machine, cutting each run to your home's exact specifications. The result is a cleaner look, better performance, and longer lifespan than sectional alternatives.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set why_us %}
<p>We've been serving northern Limestone County for over 20 years. We're not a company that reluctantly drives to rural areas — we enjoy working on country properties with their unique character and challenges.</p>
{% endset %}

